#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Mart/scripts.inc:65
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Mart_Text_WeakWillGrowStronger"
msgid ""
"Even if a POKéMON is weak now,\n"
"it will grow stronger.\p"
"The most important thing is love!\n"
"Love for your POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""
"即使宝可梦现在还很弱，\n"
"它也会慢慢变强的。\p"
"最重要的是爱！\n"
"对宝可梦的爱！$"

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Mart/scripts.inc:71
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Mart_Text_RepelIsUseful"
msgid ""
"Do you use REPEL?\n"
"It keeps POKéMON away, so it's\l"
"useful when you're in a hurry.$"
msgstr ""
"你用过除虫喷雾吗？\n"
"它能让宝可梦不靠近你，\l"
"赶路的时候特别好用。$"

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Mart/scripts.inc:76
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Mart_Text_TakeSomeAntidotesWithYou"
msgid ""
"Do you have any ANTIDOTES with\n"
"you?\p"
"If you walk around with a poisoned\n"
"POKéMON, it will lose HP until it faints.\l"
"Take some ANTIDOTES with you.$"
msgstr ""
"你有带解毒药吗？\p"
"要是宝可梦中毒了还继续走路，\n"
"它的HP会一直减少，直到濒死。\l"
"还是带上一些解毒药吧。$"
